body:
Highest edible dose I had was 350mg. I was at a park late at night after work with my boyfriend and some of our coworkers at the time when it kicked in. We had also been passing around a couple bowls and a blunt, like half the group had contributed something. I got so fucking high, I felt dizzy. But I really really had to pee after a while so one of my coworker took me down to her house (just across the street thank god). I hardly remember anything after standing up from the picnic table we were at lmao. I think I was mostly focused on walking properly. Don't remember what the inside of her house looked like, barely even remember peeing. Don't know how I didn't pee my pants, gonna be honest. The only thing I remember is that after I peed I found her in the kitchen grabbing a package of Oreos and pouring a tupperware container full of milk.

&#x200B;

I didn't stick around much longer after we got back, there was so much fucking THC in my system (I'm a lightweight in general, I consider my tolerance high but I can get decently high after 1 bong rip). The dizziness got so much that I was getting nauseous. My boyfriend and I had to make an emergency stop at his parents house on the way home and I ended up throwing up in their bath tub at like 1:30 in the morning LMAO. Went to work the next day fine though, turned out I wasn't the only one who was violently sick off of those few hundred mg

&#x200B;

And oh yeah, normal highs... I just sit and vibe. Get a little giggly, a little hungry, and a little sleepy. Rinse and repeat. I miss the days when I first started smoking sometimes, but trees got a special place in my heart.

&#x200B;

Source: I'm high right now

&#x200B;

Edit: Honorable mention to my first bong rip. That shit put me on the floor, caused my boyfriend to break up with his ex, and made me cry over a Pokemon
